// Status: transport_required (bridges: hol_finite_finite, hol_num_omega, nat_le_SNoLe)
Theorem num_FINITE : forall s c= omega, finite s <-> exists a :e omega, forall x :e omega, x :e s -> x <= a.
Admitted.

